WEBVTT

00:00:01.031 --> 00:00:07.441
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:15.271
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.651 --> 00:00:21.091
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:26.251
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:33.151
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.331 --> 00:00:37.131
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.471 --> 00:00:44.101
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.411 --> 00:00:52.211
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.381 --> 00:00:59.451
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.661 --> 00:01:05.691
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:11.661
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.671 --> 00:01:19.081
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.751 --> 00:01:27.021
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:30.521 --> 00:01:31.781
It's magic!

00:01:33.161 --> 00:01:35.421
It's just like Umi's Water Dragon.

00:01:35.691 --> 00:01:37.891
That thing is made out of magic!

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:43.231
Hikaru!

00:01:54.911 --> 00:01:56.011
Damn you!

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.031
W-What?

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:30.571
It disappeared...

00:02:31.021 --> 00:02:32.681
What's going on?

00:02:33.451 --> 00:02:34.581
No idea...

00:02:34.691 --> 00:02:40.651
The Secret of the Pillar of Cephiro

00:03:07.621 --> 00:03:09.921
Cephiro's Pillar is no longer here.

00:03:10.021 --> 00:03:14.321
This country is as fleeting
as shadows dancing on water.

00:03:16.861 --> 00:03:20.701
Cephiro and all
living things in this land...

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:23.171
...are mine.

00:03:30.681 --> 00:03:31.941
Stop...

00:03:32.041 --> 00:03:33.101
Stop!

00:03:49.231 --> 00:03:50.391
Ms. Hikaru?

00:03:50.501 --> 00:03:53.561
What's wrong?
Standing up so suddenly like that...

00:03:59.271 --> 00:04:04.271
This is the room that Clef said we
could use while we were in Cephiro.

00:04:05.481 --> 00:04:08.141
What was that room
full of water before?

00:04:08.251 --> 00:04:09.681
And that voice...

00:04:09.781 --> 00:04:14.411
That voice I've been hearing since before
I was summoned back to Cephiro...

00:04:14.691 --> 00:04:16.351
Whose voice is that?

00:04:22.231 --> 00:04:25.221
What's wrong, Hikaru?
Do you feel sick?

00:04:28.971 --> 00:04:30.901
You're a little feverish.

00:04:32.301 --> 00:04:36.501
I cannot heal illnesses with
my magic. Take care of yourself...

00:04:38.581 --> 00:04:40.341
It's all right. I'm fine.

00:04:44.221 --> 00:04:47.051
I can't trust you when
you say, "It's all right."

00:04:47.151 --> 00:04:50.821
You overexert yourself,
and when you're in pain or suffering...

00:04:50.921 --> 00:04:52.751
...you never show it.

00:04:52.961 --> 00:04:55.451
You're always worried about others...

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:59.391
Nothing's less reliable
than when you say, "It's all right."

00:05:00.101 --> 00:05:01.291
Ms. Hikaru.

00:05:01.531 --> 00:05:06.661
We have ended up being able
to fight together in Cephiro again.

00:05:08.271 --> 00:05:11.471
We go to different schools.
Our homes are far apart.

00:05:11.581 --> 00:05:12.671
However...

00:05:12.811 --> 00:05:14.901
What happened here in Cephiro...

00:05:15.011 --> 00:05:17.881
...is a precious memory
for the three of us.

00:05:18.281 --> 00:05:19.271
Fuu...

00:05:20.021 --> 00:05:24.011
I consider you and
Ms. Umi my comrades.

00:05:24.721 --> 00:05:27.321
Comrades dearer than anyone else.

00:05:30.731 --> 00:05:33.201
My elder sister told me something.

00:05:33.301 --> 00:05:36.131
It is tough if no one
understands your worries.

00:05:36.231 --> 00:05:39.641
But if someone does...
If someone worries with you...

00:05:39.741 --> 00:05:43.871
...and someone finds the solution
to your worries with you...

00:05:43.981 --> 00:05:45.911
...you will be all right.

00:05:47.211 --> 00:05:50.341
Ms. Hikaru, if something
is bothering you...

00:05:50.451 --> 00:05:54.751
...and you feel that you can
discuss it with us, please tell us.

00:05:57.661 --> 00:05:58.751
Umi...

00:05:59.421 --> 00:06:00.391
Fuu...

00:06:00.491 --> 00:06:01.651
Thank you.

00:06:06.401 --> 00:06:08.491
You're one of us too of course.

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:10.631
You traveled with us the whole time.

00:06:13.101 --> 00:06:16.601
Mokona feels as nice
to the touch as ever.

00:06:18.141 --> 00:06:21.081
I wonder what
Sir Mokona is made of?

00:06:21.911 --> 00:06:25.821
Mokona hops around a lot, so I
wonder if it's something bouncy?

00:06:25.921 --> 00:06:27.381
I think...

00:06:27.651 --> 00:06:31.211
...Mokona's filled with
marshmallows or ice cream!

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:34.721
My, that sounds delicious!

00:06:34.961 --> 00:06:37.891
But, Ms. Umi,
will you be eating Sir Mokona?

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:42.731
Hey, you!

00:06:42.731 --> 00:06:43.741
Hey, you!
I wouldn't mind some
sweet white bean paste...

00:06:43.741 --> 00:06:46.231
I wouldn't mind some
sweet white bean paste...

00:06:49.211 --> 00:06:52.871
It's all right, Mokona.
Umi wouldn't eat you.

00:06:54.851 --> 00:06:58.581
I don't know about that...
I could use a snack right about now...

00:06:59.181 --> 00:07:01.151
Hey, you! Snack! Wait!

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:02.581
Come on!

00:07:22.271 --> 00:07:24.871
Hikaru, you love those two?

00:07:25.581 --> 00:07:26.601
Who...

00:07:26.711 --> 00:07:28.141
Who is it?

00:07:29.011 --> 00:07:31.711
I hate everyone you love, Hikaru.

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:34.081
I hate them so much.

00:07:38.221 --> 00:07:40.921
I'll start off by killing those two.

00:07:41.431 --> 00:07:43.421
Wait... Who are you?

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:45.961
Me?

00:07:48.871 --> 00:07:50.531
You'll meet me soon.

00:07:50.641 --> 00:07:51.861
Very soon...

00:07:52.341 --> 00:07:53.271
Wait!

00:07:54.641 --> 00:07:55.771
Soon...

00:07:56.841 --> 00:07:58.171
Very soon...

00:08:30.111 --> 00:08:32.411
What? What is this?

00:08:34.681 --> 00:08:36.811
Umi! Fuu! Mokona!

00:08:36.921 --> 00:08:38.511
Are you all right?

00:08:39.721 --> 00:08:41.411
Are we under attack?

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:43.951
I believe the earth itself is shaking!

00:08:45.661 --> 00:08:47.631
Cephiro is disappearing...

00:09:03.071 --> 00:09:06.101
Another portion of
Cephiro has been lost.

00:09:07.211 --> 00:09:08.271
Clef...

00:09:09.111 --> 00:09:12.141
We have little time left.

00:09:13.121 --> 00:09:14.641
Clef! Clef!

00:09:14.751 --> 00:09:16.521
Are you all right?

00:09:17.991 --> 00:09:19.181
Hikaru?

00:09:21.491 --> 00:09:22.421
Clef!

00:09:23.231 --> 00:09:24.421
You all right?

00:09:24.531 --> 00:09:26.331
Was anyone injured?

00:09:27.871 --> 00:09:31.101
We're all right. You weren't hurt?

00:09:46.351 --> 00:09:47.681
That quake...

00:09:47.951 --> 00:09:50.051
Cephiro is disappearing...

00:09:50.561 --> 00:09:52.491
...at an alarming rate.

00:09:54.561 --> 00:09:56.421
We don't have much time.

00:09:56.531 --> 00:09:57.621
Yes...

00:10:00.301 --> 00:10:02.791
If a new Pillar is not born...

00:10:02.901 --> 00:10:05.841
...Cephiro is sure
to completely disappear.

00:10:07.441 --> 00:10:08.531
Pillar...

00:10:22.791 --> 00:10:27.421
However, most of the inhabitants
of Cephiro are already in this castle.

00:10:27.531 --> 00:10:31.361
How can we find any more
candidates for the Pillar?

00:10:31.461 --> 00:10:34.591
Say, how is the Pillar
of Cephiro chosen?

00:10:34.701 --> 00:10:37.291
Is there a test or something like that?

00:10:37.401 --> 00:10:41.101
Or do you need to have some
qualifications to be the Pillar?

00:10:41.211 --> 00:10:44.661
Since you're the Magic Knights,
I suppose I can tell you.

00:11:04.201 --> 00:11:05.291
Where...

00:11:32.591 --> 00:11:33.681
This is...

00:11:36.491 --> 00:11:41.631
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:43.501 --> 00:11:47.631
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:59.321 --> 00:12:01.751
It's the room I saw in my dream...

00:12:15.031 --> 00:12:16.471
That crown...

00:12:16.771 --> 00:12:18.701
Is it Princess Emeraude's?

00:12:19.101 --> 00:12:20.041
Yes.

00:12:21.441 --> 00:12:24.031
That is Princess Emeraude's crown.

00:12:24.141 --> 00:12:27.081
It shows that she
was the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:12:30.281 --> 00:12:31.911
Princess Emeraude...

00:12:48.301 --> 00:12:51.031
That crown chooses its owner.

00:12:51.141 --> 00:12:52.071
Chooses?

00:12:52.171 --> 00:12:57.231
That crown can only be touched by
one worthy of being Cephiro's Pillar.

00:13:00.041 --> 00:13:05.311
Only those with the strength of
heart to support Cephiro can wear it.

00:13:05.421 --> 00:13:07.681
It is a living magic circlet.

00:13:07.791 --> 00:13:08.981
Living...

00:13:09.521 --> 00:13:12.721
If one worthy of being
the Pillar is beside it...

00:13:12.821 --> 00:13:16.851
...the crown will change into
the shape most suited for its master.

00:13:16.961 --> 00:13:20.991
That crown is still the shape it was
when Princess Emeraude was Pillar.

00:13:21.101 --> 00:13:25.031
It's a sign that there's no one
worthy of becoming the Pillar.

00:13:28.011 --> 00:13:29.471
Stop, Hikaru!

00:13:29.671 --> 00:13:33.441
Only those worthy of becoming
the Pillar can enter this room.

00:13:34.181 --> 00:13:35.341
No way...

00:13:36.011 --> 00:13:38.171
It's the end if you step in.

00:13:38.281 --> 00:13:40.941
You wouldn't be able
to step out alive!

00:13:42.021 --> 00:13:43.581
Even if nothing's there?

00:13:43.691 --> 00:13:46.381
The room itself is protected by magic.

00:13:47.531 --> 00:13:48.361
Magic?

00:14:03.941 --> 00:14:06.071
That water is alive.

00:14:06.611 --> 00:14:09.581
The crown is protected by this room.

00:14:09.681 --> 00:14:14.381
Furthermore, those without the
strength of heart cannot even touch it.

00:14:17.461 --> 00:14:20.021
However, the one
with that strong heart...

00:14:20.121 --> 00:14:23.581
...does not necessarily
have to be from Cephiro.

00:14:23.691 --> 00:14:25.891
Clef, is this inside the castle?

00:14:26.001 --> 00:14:26.961
Yes.

00:14:27.061 --> 00:14:28.961
The top floor of this castle.

00:14:29.071 --> 00:14:33.941
Also, you must be well-gifted with
magical power to enter this place.

00:14:34.571 --> 00:14:36.401
There aren't any stairs?

00:14:36.511 --> 00:14:40.101
No, this entire floor
is protected by a barrier.

00:14:40.211 --> 00:14:43.411
You must break that
barrier to even step in here.

00:14:43.811 --> 00:14:45.081
Furthermore...

00:14:45.721 --> 00:14:49.281
This room's door doesn't
open unless you have this ring.

00:14:49.391 --> 00:14:53.321
Then the only one who can
open this door is you, Mr. Clef?

00:14:56.161 --> 00:14:59.391
Three magic items
can open this door.

00:14:59.501 --> 00:15:02.161
The magic ring that I have here.

00:15:02.271 --> 00:15:07.201
The magic plate worn by Zagato,
Princess Emeraude's high priest.

00:15:07.871 --> 00:15:09.271
And the third...

00:15:09.511 --> 00:15:12.671
...belongs to Princess Emeraude's
former magic swordsman...

00:15:12.781 --> 00:15:14.871
...Lantis's magic sword.

00:15:15.481 --> 00:15:16.571
Lantis.

00:15:27.961 --> 00:15:29.051
Cephiro...

00:15:29.931 --> 00:15:32.361
It was such
a beautiful, peaceful land...

00:15:32.601 --> 00:15:35.031
Now that it's lost
its Pillar of support...

00:15:35.131 --> 00:15:37.971
...it has turned into
this desolate wasteland?

00:15:50.551 --> 00:15:52.521
You were still here, Lantis?

00:15:53.451 --> 00:15:56.611
This is the warmest spot
in the entire castle.

00:15:56.721 --> 00:15:59.421
You are Cephiro's
only magic swordsman.

00:15:59.521 --> 00:16:02.291
What are you doing,
napping the afternoons so?

00:16:02.391 --> 00:16:04.121
Magic swordsman or not...

00:16:04.231 --> 00:16:08.671
...Cephiro is supported by the heart
of its Pillar, Princess Emeraude.

00:16:08.771 --> 00:16:10.321
Thus, there's no war.

00:16:10.431 --> 00:16:14.131
And I don't set out
to fight monsters until after dusk.

00:16:16.541 --> 00:16:18.171
What's wrong, Zagato?

00:16:18.881 --> 00:16:21.811
Lantis, what do
you think of the Pillar?

00:16:24.281 --> 00:16:27.251
Everything about this world
depends on the Pillar...

00:16:27.351 --> 00:16:29.681
What do you think of this system?

00:16:30.421 --> 00:16:34.521
Those who can become the Pillar
have stronger hearts than anyone.

00:16:34.631 --> 00:16:39.221
And those who become the Pillar
are also the creators of Cephiro.

00:16:40.261 --> 00:16:43.631
However, are their
hearts really free?

00:16:43.901 --> 00:16:44.991
Zagato...

00:16:54.981 --> 00:16:56.111
Zagato...

00:17:18.241 --> 00:17:21.901
I'm against it! You can't
go alone. Absolutely not!

00:17:21.971 --> 00:17:24.411
I am against the idea as well.

00:17:24.511 --> 00:17:29.001
Me too. It's too dangerous for you
to go outside the castle by yourself.

00:17:29.111 --> 00:17:32.881
But there's no one in this castle
who can become the Pillar, right?

00:17:32.981 --> 00:17:35.651
Then someone might
be outside the castle!

00:17:35.751 --> 00:17:40.321
But still, it's too dangerous to go
by yourself! I'm against it too!

00:17:40.421 --> 00:17:42.121
I'll go with you.

00:17:42.231 --> 00:17:43.421
You can't.

00:17:43.531 --> 00:17:46.551
Two Magic Knights
shouldn't leave the castle.

00:17:47.571 --> 00:17:52.501
What would happen if the battleships
from Autozam or Fahren attack again?

00:17:52.601 --> 00:17:57.041
Then it would be a larger problem
to not have all three in one place.

00:17:57.811 --> 00:18:01.241
It'll be fine. I'm sure I can
tell if a battleship comes.

00:18:01.351 --> 00:18:03.581
I'll call my Rune-God and rush back.

00:18:03.681 --> 00:18:07.581
And it could be someone
might still be left out there.

00:18:08.551 --> 00:18:11.151
Just like that woman
Lantis brought back.

00:18:14.161 --> 00:18:15.281
I know!

00:18:15.391 --> 00:18:18.361
I'll ask Lantis if he'll come with me!

00:18:18.461 --> 00:18:20.521
That tall man in black armor?

00:18:21.531 --> 00:18:24.021
The fact that he saved that woman...

00:18:24.141 --> 00:18:26.831
...means he knows
Cephiro's current landscape.

00:18:26.941 --> 00:18:30.701
And if he's a magic swordsman,
he's got to be strong.

00:18:31.211 --> 00:18:32.511
Right, Clef?

00:18:35.311 --> 00:18:36.241
Clef?

00:18:37.451 --> 00:18:39.081
He is indeed strong.

00:18:39.181 --> 00:18:42.741
He has enough magic power
to match his brother, Zagato...

00:18:42.851 --> 00:18:46.691
...yet no one could win
a sword fight against Lantis either.

00:18:46.791 --> 00:18:48.951
However, Lantis...

00:18:49.491 --> 00:18:52.221
...left Cephiro and stayed in Autozam.

00:18:52.831 --> 00:18:53.921
Autozam...

00:18:55.101 --> 00:18:57.431
That is one of the invading countries.

00:18:57.971 --> 00:18:59.271
And Lantis...

00:18:59.601 --> 00:19:03.561
...has the magic sword that
can open the room of the Pillar.

00:19:07.681 --> 00:19:11.051
I'm sure you'll laugh
at me when I say this...

00:19:11.751 --> 00:19:14.341
...but I don't think Lantis is a bad guy.

00:19:15.091 --> 00:19:17.021
Why do you think so?

00:19:17.761 --> 00:19:20.661
Because he has
a sad look in his eyes...

00:19:22.531 --> 00:19:26.021
I have no proof. But his eyes...

00:19:26.701 --> 00:19:28.761
...are solitary, so lonely...

00:19:29.101 --> 00:19:31.261
They're like wolves in the winter.

00:19:33.341 --> 00:19:34.401
I'm going!

00:19:34.511 --> 00:19:37.941
I'll be all right.
I'll come back for sure!

00:19:59.761 --> 00:20:03.891
Fools who keep fighting
without noticing my existence...

00:20:05.341 --> 00:20:08.741
It would be better to quietly
wait for all to disappear.

00:20:08.841 --> 00:20:10.741
But Hikaru noticed.

00:20:12.881 --> 00:20:16.401
The one who discovered
our existence through dreams.

00:20:16.511 --> 00:20:18.641
One who will become our foe.

00:20:18.751 --> 00:20:20.941
I want to play with Hikaru.

00:20:21.391 --> 00:20:23.881
You were born for that one.

00:20:24.051 --> 00:20:27.821
Just wait a while longer.
You will meet her soon.

00:20:29.491 --> 00:20:31.931
I want to play with Hikaru soon!

00:20:32.131 --> 00:20:35.031
Anything Hikaru loves, I hate!

00:20:35.131 --> 00:20:39.631
I'll paint those two girls that
Hikaru loves in bright-red blood.

00:20:41.271 --> 00:20:44.611
I'll beautifully rip
apart that body of hers.

00:20:45.511 --> 00:20:47.441
I'm looking forward to it.

00:20:57.421 --> 00:21:01.121
When the last Pillar,
Princess Emeraude, disappeared...

00:21:01.231 --> 00:21:04.721
...who saved you when you
were escaping from the castle?

00:21:05.431 --> 00:21:07.091
You did, my lady.

00:21:07.201 --> 00:21:09.631
Who do you owe your life to?

00:21:09.931 --> 00:21:12.601
My life belongs to you, my lady.

00:21:13.471 --> 00:21:18.741
Alcyone, do you detest that high priest
who did not reciprocate your love?

00:21:18.841 --> 00:21:19.931
Yes.

00:21:20.141 --> 00:21:23.841
Your hatred amuses me.

00:21:24.951 --> 00:21:26.541
People's hatred...

00:21:26.651 --> 00:21:27.781
Their pain...

00:21:27.951 --> 00:21:29.441
...is my joy.

00:21:29.821 --> 00:21:31.081
My power.

00:21:32.221 --> 00:21:35.661
You will be of good
use to me, Alcyone.

00:21:39.201 --> 00:21:40.791
As you wish...

00:21:43.031 --> 00:21:44.331
...Lady Debonair.

00:22:17.941 --> 00:22:23.341
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.011 --> 00:22:31.281
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.721 --> 00:22:38.281
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.991 --> 00:22:42.791
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.161 --> 00:22:45.531
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.361 --> 00:22:50.661
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.041 --> 00:22:54.371
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.811 --> 00:23:01.711
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.151 --> 00:23:05.551
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.881 --> 00:23:14.311
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.161 --> 00:23:20.491
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.731 --> 00:23:28.801
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.871 --> 00:23:37.681
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.161 --> 00:23:48.021
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.461 --> 00:23:53.121
I was able to go outside
with Lantis after much persuasion.

00:23:53.801 --> 00:23:57.291
A world devastated...
and all the monsters that attacked...

00:23:57.401 --> 00:23:59.891
...were much stronger than before.

00:24:00.001 --> 00:24:03.771
And suddenly, a white machine
appeared in front of our eyes.

00:24:03.871 --> 00:24:05.501
Is that Eagle?

00:24:05.881 --> 00:24:07.711
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.811 --> 00:24:09.411
Hikaru and Lantis's Dangerous Journey.

00:24:09.411 --> 00:24:10.711
Hikaru and Lantis's Dangerous Journey
Hikaru and Lantis's Dangerous Journey.

00:24:10.711 --> 00:24:13.421
Hikaru and Lantis's Dangerous Journey
You have to watch it!

00:24:13.421 --> 00:24:20.291
Who is it today?

00:24:21.231 --> 00:24:23.321
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:23.431 --> 00:24:29.391
Look forward to the next episode!
